00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:42.700
I know it will. Charlotte.

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:43.440
What?

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:44.320
Look at the wall.

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:45.580
The wall again?

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:46.640
Look at the wall, Charlotte.

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:47.240
Such nonsense.

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:47.600
Look!

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:06.740
I didn't have enough courage to drink more than a sip.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:11.600
Now, I must find courage enough to face the guillotine, eh, Inspector?

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.880
What about her? She touched any of this?

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:20.230
No, it must have been her heart, the shock.

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:23.700
She dropped to the floor like a stone after seeing it.

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:27.090
Don't touch it! I had to cover it!

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:29.970
I couldn't stand it! I couldn't stand it!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:49.260
you couldn't stand what marquis de roger went to the guillotine

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:55.060
insisting there was an image on this wall and at his trial his servants swore

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:59.980
under oath that something was on the wall something that could not be removed

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:08.990
well there is something isn't there doesn't look very terrifying but in the village there are those

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:15.140
who will tell you that on the anniversary of her death the face of jeanette sometimes reappears

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:24.840
true or false jeanette died on the 12th of april now if some april 12th you happen to be in the

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:29.980
vicinity why not call the local estate agent he'll escort you up the hill

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:43.100
and you can see for yourself in a moment something about next week when a dominating personality lives

00:24:43.100 --> 00:24:49.290
in a house for a long time he seems to leave an indelible and sometimes evil imprint in the very

00:24:49.290 --> 00:24:54.180
atmosphere of the place if you're inclined to doubt this be with us next week and see what happens

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:55.180
to the captain's guest
